messages:
Maya L: quick question — wiring the JS client to our private VPC endpoint behind corp-proxy. Ran into streaming stalls when we set a custom host header.
Alex P: what do you mean by stalls? does the connection drop or just no chunks arrive?
Maya L: chunks stop arriving after ~15s, connection stays open. If I hit the hosted redwood endpoint there’s no problem. Only when routing via proxy + custom host header.
Jin: likely SNI vs Host mismatch. If TLS SNI is the proxy hostname but Host header is the internal target, some proxies buffer or rewrite. What proxy vendor?
Maya L: nginx at the edge (managed by infra). We were setting Host: internal.redwood-vpc and using proxy.example.com as the proxy SNI.
Sophie: common trick: set TLS servername to the proxy host while preserving Host header for routing. In Node that’s `servername` on the TLS socket. Also check proxy buffering settings (proxy_buffering off for chunked streaming).
Alex P: also note the SDK retry/backoff can make it look like a stall if the proxy returns a 200 with no body yet. We added a tiny client-side keepalive to force some bytes through and it helped.
Maya L: here's the minimal Node snippet that fixed it for us:
```
const client = new RedwoodClient({
  apiKey: process.env.RW_API_KEY,
  baseHost: process.env.RW_PRIVATE_HOST,
  fetchOptions: {
    headers: { Host: 'internal.redwood-vpc' }
  },
  tls: { servername: 'proxy.example.com' }
});
await client.stream(...);
```
Jin: nice. For Python folks: ensure `session.trust_env = False` if you don't want system `HTTP_PROXY` to inject unexpected proxying/pipelining. Also `requests` can buffer—use `stream=True` and iterate.
Sophie: small warning to the team — in dev we briefly set `NODE_TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0` to unblock a self-signed cert. DO NOT ship that. Instead add the CA to the container's trust store or set `TRUSTED_CA_CERT` env to the PEM.
Alex P: added: proxy side change we made was `proxy_buffering off; proxy_http_version 1.1; chunked_transfer_encoding on;` That unblocked streaming for our nginx config.
DevEx Bot: (note) Created docs draft: /docs/devex/vpc-proxy-host-override-patterns — will add code snippets and infra flags.
Maya L: perfect. @Alex P can you paste the exact nginx snippet in the docs? will close this thread after doc PR. :white_check_mark:
